    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389290/extras/68e4efde441c41994d5cac18032540a2.avif?t=1747041255\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span>Naughty Store Manager is a simulator game where you need to manage a store inherited after your father's death. Along with the store, you also inherited his debt to a yakuza member. The only way out is to upgrade the store and pay off the loan. Fortunately, you have great workers to help you!\u00a0\u00a0What would it lead to? Find out in Naughty Store Manager!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389290/extras/4d6f2c46e6aefa3a615208f515b22da5.poster.avif?t=1747041255\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389290/extras/4d6f2c46e6aefa3a615208f515b22da5.webm?t=1747041255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389290/extras/4d6f2c46e6aefa3a615208f515b22da5.mp4?t=1747041255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389290/extras/929e88e837745c3c01bc98ea7f52d272.avif?t=1747041255\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389290/extras/771c3b3d5854541e9cecc359aa4f8925.poster.avif?t=1747041255\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389290/extras/771c3b3d5854541e9cecc359aa4f8925.webm?t=1747041255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\