s, keep the warehouse tidy, deal with the trash, and don\u2019t skip out on cleaning\u2014customers are lining up at the checkout!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a supermarket manager with a story full of twists and turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your crew, keep their spirits high, and build relationships to uncover what makes them tick!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
